
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. ITEMUPD.

ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
FILE-CONTROL.

    SELECT ITEM-MASTER
    ASSIGN TO ITEMMAST
    ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
    ACCESS MODE IS SEQUENTIAL
    RECORD KEY IS ITEM-ID
    FILE STATUS IS WS-STATUS.

DATA DIVISION.
FILE SECTION.

FD ITEM-MASTER.

01 ITEM-REC.
   05 ITEM-ID         PIC X(8).
   05 ITEM-STOCK-QTY  PIC 9(5).

WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.

01 WS-STATUS          PIC XX.
01 WS-SOLD-QTY        PIC 9(5) VALUE 25.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.

    OPEN I-O ITEM-MASTER

    IF WS-STATUS = '00'

       READ ITEM-MASTER NEXT RECORD

       IF WS-STATUS = '00'

          SUBTRACT WS-SOLD-QTY
             FROM ITEM-STOCK-QTY

          REWRITE ITEM-REC
             INVALID KEY
                PERFORM 9100-REWRITE-ERR
          END-REWRITE

          IF WS-STATUS = '00'
             DISPLAY 'STOCK UPDATED SUCCESSFULLY'
             DISPLAY 'ITEM ID: ' ITEM-ID
             DISPLAY 'NEW STOCK: ' ITEM-STOCK-QTY
          END-IF

       ELSE
          DISPLAY 'READ FAILED'
       END-IF

       CLOSE ITEM-MASTER

    ELSE
       DISPLAY 'FILE OPEN FAILED'
    END-IF

    STOP RUN.

9100-REWRITE-ERR.
    DISPLAY 'REWRITE FAILED'
    DISPLAY 'FILE STATUS: ' WS-STATUS.
